        {
          "text": "Har’ ico biriko? Kizima mu buryo bgose, ari mu buryarya ari mu kuri, Kristo avugwa, kand’ ivyo ndabinezererewe, kandi nzokwama mbinezererwa; ",
          "type": "text",
